### Task Prompt Template (`.prompt(...)` in your processing loop)

Inside your loop, fetch one `incident_source` record, format its metadata and raw text, and pass it directly to `.prompt(...)`:

```markdown
Source ID: {record_id}
Discovered URL: {url}
Reported Date Context: {reported_date}

Raw Document Text:
"""
{raw_text}
"""

Extract the crime details from this text into the required JSON schema.
